    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3487b125d829f88",
      "translationZh": "困惑度约高出 40%，而基准测试成绩在 ARC 上下降最多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
